{"id":"898e3b7dd0d559a6","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph.md","title":"ZFC Comb6 Bipartite Graph","display":"df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph — ZFC Comb6 Bipartite Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph"],"display":"df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph — ZFC Comb6 Bipartite Graph","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-graph]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph — ZFC Comb6 Bipartite Graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,E,A,B\">\\(V,E,A,B\\)</span> 为集合；此行的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是顶点集，不是集合宇宙 (vertex set, edge set, and bipartition classes)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S\\)</span> (simple-graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6BipartiteGraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Set}^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6BipartiteGraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Set}^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Set}\">\\(\\mathsf{Set}\\)</span> 为集合变量的元类型；此类型记号不表示顶点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}bipartite\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6BipartiteGraph}_S(V,E,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land V=A\\cup B\\land A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;(|e\\cap A|=1\\land|e\\cap B|=1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}bipartite\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6BipartiteGraph}_S(V,E,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land V=A\\cup B\\land A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;(|e\\cap A|=1\\land|e\\cap B|=1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC combinatorial definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S$ (simple-graph predicate, see [[58-df-graph]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,E,A,B","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6BipartiteGraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Set}^4","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}bipartite\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6BipartiteGraph}_S(V,E,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land V=A\\cup B\\land A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;(|e\\cap A|=1\\land|e\\cap B|=1)","display":true}],"bytes":1186,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1667","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph.md|58-df-zfc-comb6-bipartite-graph]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0dc79ccc1050ee64","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}